NAME
	ls, list, gib

SYNOPSIS
	this lists all files and directory in the working directory the process is in, the options changes the format or show aditional files or directories.

OPTIONS
	the options of our ls is the same as ls in the /bin directory.
	
	-l : long format shows permissions, file count, owner, group, byte size, date and time created.
	-a : shows the previous level '..' and current level '.' directory files.

COMMAND EXPLANATION
	Using the /bin comand with passed parametres and arguments from the user input.
	
	RETURNS
	 0 - successful execution of this command.
	-1 - failure of command execution.
	
